 "text": "*Crucis / Q1 project update* (DLV-05, DLV-06, BLD-11)\n\n• Crucis now has its own <https://github.com/crucis-lab/crucis|public repository> and <https://crucis-lab.github.io/crucis/|documentation site>, with Apache-2.0 licensing. Install from the repository; the package/command is `crucis-causal` and the Python import is `crucis_causal`.\n• Cross-platform package CI passes. Main requires pull requests and passing checks; local commits happen automatically after validated milestones. Site deployment uses the validated source commit.\n• <https://uzairgheewala.github.io/cc-research/|cc-research> presents the research findings and approach. The older refinement reproduction is labeled as a companion study.\n• Connection and experiment-definition foundations are implemented and tested. Execution/collection is in design; the broader framework and benchmark remain in development.\n• The checkpoint is due 6 Nov. Its numerical evidence basis is frozen; manuscript corrections, citations and the PDF remain to finish. The final-study scope and funding are proposals for mentor review. No new paid campaign has started.",
